## Coordinate
`crates/chrysalis` is YOUR crate → monotone, act freely, sync via the board. BUT
Stage 2 reshapes `eval.rs` term dispatch (a shared internal seam) and Stage 4 touches
the chrysalis↔prism boundary — if you change a **public** chrysalis API or a shared
`.ys` vocabulary, `touching:` it + drop a board `note` first (CALM / ROSTER §regimes).
Pair with `unify` on the Stage-2 factoring and the Stage-4 design; with `simplify` on
the Stage-3 one-door guard (don't let your N→1 collapse regress).

